# R91-A stage-1 input-norm probe knob (research instrument, NOT a shipping change)
#
# Adds DARKBLOOM_R91_INPUT_NORM_PROBE to LagunaRuntimeModel.swift:
#   0  base   normalized = inputNorm(input)                       (shipped path)
#  -1  skipr  normalized = input                                  NOT bit-exact
#  -2  skipc  normalized = inputNorm.weight broadcast             NOT bit-exact
#   2  dupn   normalized = maximum(inputNorm(x), inputNorm(x))     bit-exact
#   3  max1   y=inputNorm(x); normalized = maximum(y, y)           bit-exact
#
# Result: the fusion prize is <= 35.02 us/step (95% UB). Family is dead.
# See research/maple-fern-r91-input-norm-fusion-price.md
#
